Package: raven-customization
Version: 0.1.3
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Raven OS Project <maintainers@ravenlinux.org>
Depends: base-files, lightdm-gtk-greeter, xfce4
Replaces: base-files, bash
Description: Raven OS identity and desktop defaults
 Installs the Raven OS release identity, shell defaults, desktop artwork,
 application icons, and XFCE and LightDM defaults used by the live image.
